        "pauseAfterMs": 3000
      },
      {
        "id": "line-2",
        "text": "嗯嗯，那你繼續走，邊走邊跟我講話。",
        "audioSrc": null,
        "pauseAfterMs": 2500
      },
      {
        "id": "line-3",
        "text": "旁邊亮不亮？往人多、有燈的那邊走。",
        "audioSrc": null,
        "pauseAfterMs": 3500
      },
      {
        "id": "line-4",
        "text": "我在聽，你不用急，慢慢講。",
        "audioSrc": null,
        "pauseAfterMs": 3000
      },
      {
        "id": "line-5",
        "text": "快到的時候跟我說一聲，我不掛電話。",
        "audioSrc": null,
        "pauseAfterMs": 3000
      },
      {
        "id": "line-6",
        "text": "要是真的覺得不對勁，馬上用求助，別管這通電話。",
        "audioSrc": null,
        "pauseAfterMs": 2000
      }
    ]
  },
